 "file_description": "Stage-2.3 golden: the ladder-served crane base carrying a live M/V-ARRANGEMENT defect at interior vertex 37 (degree 6, M=2 V=4, |M-V|=2 and Kawasaki 5.7e-07 deg BOTH pass, yet the big-little-big crimp reduction is stuck). Oriedita independently reports LITTLE_BIG_LITTLE at the same vertex. Provenance: cached HF crane mesh sha256 ca8680d8019b21b20012798d4b81b913378c4f3f515baab803d21821a1a975da, mesh_to_metric_tree(voxel_res=96, prune_fraction=0.2), perturb ladder rung 2 (seed 0, the rung the server serves). RAW rung fold: the ladder frame_title annotations are NOT applied, so this is exactly what cp_audit/_audit_pack see.",
